OL,3,GNEWSADerelict factory demolition gets
OL,4,Aunder way
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemolition work has started on two
OL,7,Fformer factory buildings in
OL,8,FStoke-on-Trent, described by an MP as
OL,9,Fan "eyesore" and for years deemed in
OL,10,Fdanger of collapse.
OL,12,FPermission was granted this summer to
OL,13,Fknock down Etruria's Old Twyford
OL,14,FBuildings, which form part of the
OL,15,FCeramic Valley Enterprise Zone along
OL,16,Fthe A500.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
