OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSADerelict factory demolition gets
OL,4,Aunder way
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe derelict site has housed large
OL,7,Famounts of industrial material and was
OL,8,Fhit by a large fire 14 years ago.
OL,9,FStoke-on-Trent MP Gareth Snell has
OL,10,Fpreviously said the state of the site
OL,11,Fhad "soured negotiations" for
OL,12,Finvestment in the city.
OL,14,FGranting permission for the demolition,
OL,15,Fthe council said the work would be
OL,16,Fcarried out in phases to minimise the
OL,17,Fimpact on the surrounding area.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
